{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261024/photo/bkn-20261024172648922-1024_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261024172648\"/><p>內羅畢（圖）發生建築倒塌事故。</p><p>肯尼亞首都內羅畢周五（23日）發生建築倒塌事故，一幢興建中多層大樓突然坍塌，造成至少7人失蹤。由於倒塌地點位於其他高層建築之間，搜救人員進入現場面臨困難。</p><p>內政部提及，建築倒塌時，一層與地下室共有11間商舖正在營業。事故發生時，現場67名施工人員中有66人安全撤離，另有一人受傷。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T09:42:48.173253+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:26:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T09:38:32.993438+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T09:38:32.993438+00:00","content_hash":"f5b0c5d7092d0db32f7b64fd832043a2f9ee8aa3d1e5471416bafcb0ba65a90c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}